# Redirect Netlify subdomain to custom domain
https://idyllic-haupia-c797a4.netlify.app/* https://picsell.ai/:splat 301!

# /uk/ was a thin duplicate of the homepage: same <title>, self-canonical,
# zero unique copy, and it was being submitted to Google via sitemap.
/uk / 301!
/uk/ / 301!
/uk/* / 301!

# Redirect old /ua/ and /ru/ paths → Ukrainian version
/ua /  301
/ua/ / 301
/ua/* / 301
/ru / 301
/ru/ / 301
/ru/* / 301

# Redirect old blog articles
/ru/blog/* /blog/ 301
/ua/blog/* /blog/ 301
